{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんわ!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は、先日の握手会でいただいた祝花を載せていきます＼(^o^)/🌷"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まずは私服と祝花。\nコリラックマがのってる!"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYKHZD5Q2NXERE2B5DZ4XQQ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">ぬいぐるみすごく可愛い〜好きな癒し系のお花でした🐻💓"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1次完売記念✨"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYKJ0JKFD6JCQMW49GQCYH3","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\nありがとう!私も凄く嬉しい〜(*´︶`*)❤︎待ってるよ🤝"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こちらこそいつもありがとう!"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYKJ1JCVDXR8RQMY0V54WYR","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\nカラフルなお花すきだ〜葉っぱ食べてる🍀お腹すいてたのかな(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここからは、パジャマ(:3_ヽ)_"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさん来てくれてありがとう!"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYKJ2JN4TNZVEZBBDG1GR1P","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n薔薇めちゃくちゃ綺麗!!🌹サイリウムカラーめでたいなあ〜目立つ!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日本一楽しい握手レーン!"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYKJ3K9651MQPS7PXJ2G3D6","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n1番!!おすすめレーンですよ〜٩(*´◒`*)۶♡来て損なし"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全力で応援してくれるみたい☺"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYKJ4HPS4CSQAD1DD7E256C","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\nじゃあ、私も全力で答えるよ〜もう21だし、のんびりしてらんない!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"綺麗なお花ありがとうございました🌸\nお花についてる一言って、毎回違くて読むのが楽しいです。\n私を応援してくれてるのがすごく伝わる!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう少しで21だけど、まだまだ負けないぞ〜\n16さ〜い〜☔(水玉模様)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"読んでくれてありがとうございました。\n⊿長沢菜々香⊿"}],"source":"archive"}